      "t": "Outside the guest restroom, Vika blocks Chef Barinov and tells him that as head chef he should stop this childish circus, while Viktor Petrovich retorts that he is not cooking inside the bathroom. Back in the kitchen, Kostya jokes about how fast Max satisfies his regular lady guest.",
      "gap": 0.8
