      "t": "Let's walk back through the scene line by line.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Правда, идет?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Does it really suit me?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Вам сюда нельзя.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are not allowed in here.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Вика, ты прекращай этот цирк.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vika, stop this circus right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Витя, ты шеф-повар этого ресторана.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vitya, you are the head chef of this restaurant.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Ты думаешь, нормально?",
      "gap": 0.55
