      "t": "'Do you think this behavior is normal?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Ну я же мне в туалете еду готовил.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, I was not cooking food inside the restroom.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "barinov",
      "t": "Пойдем на кухню.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let us go back to the kitchen.'",
      "gap": 0.45
